{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > You are the last Ritualist, a blade against the creeping dark. Armed with forbidden knowledge and cursed steel, you must descend into dungeons, where every shadow hides teeth and every corridor twists with the weight of forgotten sins!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3179460/extras/9f9b6232d81b8732b5992b00be7d3331.poster.avif?t=1759786981\" width=616 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3179460/extras/9f9b6232d81b8732b5992b00be7d3331.webm?t=1759786981\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3179460/extras/9f9b6232d81b8732b5992b00be7d3331.mp4?t=1759786981\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 <strong>Dynamic, Skill-Based Combat</strong> \u2013 Evade enemy attacks and unleash devastating abilities in fast-paced, tactical battles.<br>\u2714 <strong>Procedural Dungeons &amp; Rewards</strong> \u2013 No two runs are the same; discover randomized loot, hidden paths, and deadly secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3179460/extras/479baf7fab543b999500f15471c3d753.poster.avif?t=1759786981\" width=616 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3179460/extras/479baf7fab543b999500f15471c3d753.webm?t=1759786981\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 <strong>Abundant Arsenal</strong> \u2013 Every choice twists combat into something new\u2014mix unique moveset of each weapon and various elemental abilities to rewrite battle on your terms. Arm yourself with the power of the ancient relics!<br>\u2714C<strong>hallenging enemies\u2014</strong>from mindless creatures to ancient, otherworldly guardians\u2014each with their own adaptive AI behaviors.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3179460/extras/45b023d96fece7bd4b7768cf82f74c12.poster.avif?t=1759786981\" width=616 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3179460/extras/45b023d96fece7bd4b7768cf82f74c12.webm?t=1759786981\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3179460/extras/45b023d96fece7bd4b7768cf82f74c12.mp4?t=1759786981\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 <strong>Ritual System</strong> \u2013 Perform dark rites to empower yourself\u2026 at a cost. Will you dare to risk?<br>\u2714 <strong>Permadeath with Meta-Progression</strong> \u2013 Fall, rise, fight again\u2014unlock new abilities with each attempt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Complete the Ritual or Die Trying!</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3179460/extras/c212d2dd0afaa5b445dd8d364b6e8097.poster.avif?t=1759786981\" width=616 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3179460/extras/c212d2dd0afaa5b445dd8d364b6e8097.webm?t=1759786981\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3179460/extras/c212d2dd0afaa5b445dd8d364b6e8097.mp4?t=1759786981\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3179460?t=1759786981","ba